WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:06.000
Steady the paper and choose a comfortable tool.
A large curve is just one possible mark.

00:06.000 --> 00:12.000
Explore a line, a curve or a dot.
You do not need to complete the shape.

00:12.000 --> 00:18.000
Pause. Creativity does not require precision.
Choose a tool or access method that works.

00:18.000 --> 00:24.000
Example replay: watch the broad curve.
Stay within your own comfortable range.

00:24.000 --> 00:30.000
Rest, or try the digital pad with buttons.
No strength or coordination score is measured.

00:30.000 --> 00:36.000
A final example: make the drawing your own.
The diagram does not prescribe your grip.

00:36.000 --> 00:42.000
Keep what you created, if you want to.
Stop if it causes discomfort or fatigue.
